        <mxCell id="c_3MuZiHcRi-rccNqymF-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;labelBorderColor=default;" value="&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-9ba7cf96-7fff-1a4a-086a-bfd6575c080b&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Responsable: Administrador del sistema de acceso.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Control: Aviso de privacidad visible y casilla de consentimiento antes de enviar el formulario. Captura mínima: solo teléfono, sin datos adicionales.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;El teléfono se usa para (1) notificar al visitante sobre su registro y (2) análisis interno de reincidencia de visitas, ambos declarados en el aviso de privacidad como finalidades necesarias.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(249, 250, 251); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: start; white-space: normal; font-size: 12pt; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&quot;Aviso visible: &#39;Este registro es procesado por un sistema automatizado&#39;.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
